# Performance Profiling Guide

## Purpose
Systematic approach to identifying and resolving performance bottlenecks in applications, especially for Python and PyTorch code.

## Core Capabilities
- CPU profiling (flamegraphs)
- Memory profiling and leak detection
- Load testing with k6/Artillery
- Before/after measurement
- Bottleneck identification

## Golden Rule: Measure First
Always establish a baseline before optimization:
- Record P50, P95, P99 latency
- Monitor RPS (requests per second)
- Track error rates
- Measure memory usage

## When to Apply
- Application is slower than expected
- High memory consumption
- Long training times in ML projects
- Preparing for increased traffic/load
- Investigating performance regressions
